=======================
R1: Emergency Triggering
Exactly two administrators are required to trigger an emergency while in Normal mode, which transitions the system to Emergency mode.

R2: Emergency Mode Duration
Emergency mode is active only for a limited (bounded) time; the system must eventually return to Normal mode.

R3: Emergency Mode Behaviors
R3.1: During Emergency mode, request processing may bypass FIFO order to prioritize and process multiple high-classification requests concurrently.
R3.2: During Emergency mode, users may temporarily hold roles that are otherwise mutually exclusive.
R3.3: During Emergency mode, administrators temporarily hold emergency privileges.

